1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
A sound soul, dwells within a sound mind, and a sound body.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Report. What is the status of the moral manipulation machine?

3
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:43,000
We've just received word from Mosquito who's in charge of the project. It's going well. The prototype is nearing completion.

4
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Are we sure that shriveled insect can handle this? He's shrunken over the last 800 years.

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
I'm sick of doing nothing. I want some action. Let me go, too.

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Your assistance will be unnecessary. I've already employed all the muscle we need.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Muscle? He's a legendary samurai. Perhaps you've heard of him. He's known as the Sword God.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
And what would make someone like the Sword God so eager to help us?

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Human beings are so very easy to control once you know their weaknesses.

10
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:35,000
What would make someone like the Sword God so eager to help us?

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,000
What would make someone like the Sword God so eager to help us?

12
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:45,000
What would make someone like the Sword God so eager to help us?

13
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:58,000
How would make someone like the Sword God so eager to help us?

14
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:04,260
Six人目も合わさず運命まで絡んでく

15
00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:10,100
行き先もらったポテル食えない夜を恥で

16
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:19,360
不可愛しすぎた眩しさが悪い夢に続いても

17
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:26,680
繋いだ魂の火が胸を刺すなら

18
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:33,440
言葉よりもっと強い響きが今聞こえるか

19
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:38,580
やっと理由は途絶びに突きつけられて

20
00:02:38,580 --> 00:02:44,660
触れた瞬間の傷の分だけ確かになれる

21
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:58,060
Soul, you don't have to feed me.

22
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:58,840
It's embarrassing.

23
00:03:00,220 --> 00:03:01,600
Don't be so stubborn.

24
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,720
You need to eat more to get your strength back.

25
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,600
The magic should work its way from your body in a few days.

26
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:09,040
We all heard her, Maka.

27
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,420
Now open up and eat something.

28
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:11,280
Ta-da!

29
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,060
Nice marker.

30
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,100
Please don't do it.

31
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,500
My autograph will do you a lot more good than any food and medicine will.

32
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,460
Now sit still.

33
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:22,460
Hey, wait.

34
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,780
No, stop it.

35
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:25,320
Get off me, Blackstar.

36
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:26,140
What do you think you're doing?

37
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:28,040
Well, if you don't have a cast to sign.

38
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:31,220
As soon as I'm feeling better, you're gonna pay for this, Blackstar.

39
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:32,620
Finished.

40
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:37,120
I've arranged all the medicine bottles to be perfectly symmetrical.

41
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:41,000
You can rest easy now that you don't have to worry about those.

42
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:43,700
Only you would worry about those.

43
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:49,600
You've got a lively bunch of visitors, Maka.

44
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,260
What brings you here, Sid?

45
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:54,140
Nygas, can I speak with you out in the hallway?

46
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:55,140
Of course.

47
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:03,900
The Sword God Rises.

48
00:04:04,340 --> 00:04:06,540
Does it have a sweet or a salty taste?

49
00:04:10,700 --> 00:04:16,860
A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body.

50
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:22,500
As it has always been.

51
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:34,700
What's got you so riled up?

52
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:39,100
Only the reckless will ever completely rid themselves of fear.

53
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:41,720
Isn't that one of the Academy's teachings?

54
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:46,340
A fear of disapproval makes one strive to be a good person.

55
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:51,380
A fear of being powerless gives one the motivation to seek out the power that lies in knowledge.

56
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:55,160
Fear is a driving force and a creator of order.

57
00:04:55,160 --> 00:05:01,920
Because of this, the amount of fear that exists in the world far exceeds the amount of actual danger that is present.

58
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:06,140
At all times, there is an excess of fear flowing from every human being.

59
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:12,640
The DWMA keeps its status by assembling people as capable and talented as you.

60
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:16,460
People who are driven to seek the power in knowledge.

61
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:20,480
By doing so, we are following the will of the Almighty God.

62
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:26,320
If such a God does exist, he is guilty of asking much and offering very little help in return.

63
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,200
We are left to take care of ourselves.

64
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:35,380
And in light of that, I prefer an offensive position to a defensive one.

65
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:38,680
As a scientist, don't you feel the same?

66
00:05:39,860 --> 00:05:41,380
Well, Star?

67
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:52,920
According to Azusa's report, she's located one of the research labs run by Arachnophobia, the witch Arachnase organization.

68
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:57,780
It seems they're in the process of developing some kind of magic tool.

69
00:05:58,380 --> 00:06:04,820
Our job is to raid the research lab, secure the plans for the tool, determine its purpose, and then destroy it.

70
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:06,080
Magic tool.

71
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:08,280
Have you heard of Abon before?

72
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:13,620
He's known for being a teacher of witches and supposedly the greatest inventor in our world's history.

73
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:18,740
We aren't sure yet, but it's likely this tool they're constructing follows Abon's design.

74
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:20,720
We'll know more soon, but we should get going.

75
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:21,440
Where to?

76
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:23,860
Azusa will brief us on the location.

77
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:24,660
Come on.

78
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,380
Right.

79
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:29,180
Arachnophobia.

80
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:31,500
They're the ones who hurt Maka.

81
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:44,520
What's our progress?

82
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:46,420
Are we getting the expected results?

83
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:50,700
The prototype has not yet achieved everything we had hoped.

84
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:56,680
But I'm certain that if we continue our research as planned, Lady Arachnase will be pleased with what we accomplish.

85
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:00,960
Insanity cannot exist in a moral vacuum.

86
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:04,500
Some morals must remain in order to give shape to the madness.

87
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:08,240
That is where our moral manipulation machine comes in.

88
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:11,880
It will alter people's sense of morality without obliterating it.

89
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:15,580
Even a slight deterioration will give rise to the madness we seek.

90
00:07:16,300 --> 00:07:20,880
This device, based upon Abon's design, will do much to further Lady Arachnase's plans.

91
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:33,300
You agreed to be our guard in exchange for the witch's protection, but perhaps you'd like a more permanent position.

92
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:35,260
No, I'm not interested.

93
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:36,500
I'm funny!

94
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:43,960
Protecting Angela is my only concern.

95
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,300
Nothing else matters to me.

96
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:54,760
What the...

97
00:07:54,760 --> 00:08:01,740
Well done.

98
00:08:01,740 --> 00:08:03,900
Azusa, do you copy?

99
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,660
We reached point B as planned.

100
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,740
No incidents to report so far.

101
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:09,080
Further instructions?

102
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,540
That was fast.

103
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:14,960
Hold on for a minute, and I'll put together a map to get you where you need to go.

104
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,780
Resonate with me now.

105
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:17,700
Audit.

106
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:19,980
L'ervoyance.

107
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:26,220
Distance to objective.

108
00:08:26,660 --> 00:08:29,620
32 meters down a hallway that is 3.2 meters wide.

109
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:32,940
All right, Sid.

110
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,620
I've completed a map of the facility.

111
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:38,760
Take your next right turn, continuing for 15 meters.

112
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:40,440
Then proceed up the staircase.

113
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:44,000
The largest room in that corridor contains your target.

114
00:08:45,020 --> 00:08:46,400
That's a nifty trick.

115
00:08:46,620 --> 00:08:47,680
She's a death scythe.

116
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:49,880
Of course she's got some cool techniques up her sleeve.

117
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:55,340
I can only see within a 50-meter range, and I have to maintain my resonance with Sid to do so,

118
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:56,480
but it comes in handy.

119
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:59,320
Anything's better than going in blind, right, Sid?

120
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:03,740
And what's more, we're using a radio as the medium to establish our soul resonance.

121
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:06,180
Azusa's the only one who can do that.

122
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:09,880
I appreciate all of the compliments, but back to business.

123
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:10,360
Right.

124
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,400
What's up ahead?

125
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:14,220
The signal from the room containing the target is weak.

126
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:18,340
Still, I am detecting a witch's soul and an old monster's soul.

127
00:09:18,980 --> 00:09:19,740
Oh, and be careful.

128
00:09:20,140 --> 00:09:22,760
There's another very strong soul in there along with them.

129
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:25,400
Yeah, I'm picking up on those souls as well.

130
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:28,680
But our assignment is to destroy the magic tool in there.

131
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,200
No matter what.

132
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,780
Intruder alert.

133
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:33,260
Intruder alert.

134
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:34,580
Not good.

135
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:35,520
We've been detected.

136
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:37,220
Hurry to the main entrance.

137
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:38,680
We need to alert the bodyguard.

138
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,960
Why the main entrance?

139
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,960
Hey, Azusa, what's going on?

140
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:43,840
Hold on.

141
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:44,560
I'm checking.

142
00:09:47,540 --> 00:09:50,180
This path leads directly to the main entrance.

143
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:59,340
What's an academy student doing here?

144
00:10:00,180 --> 00:10:01,640
Keep on coming at me.

145
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:04,040
I'll tear every single one of you into pieces.

146
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:08,440
My, what a lively young guest we have here.

147
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:12,340
That girl.

148
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:13,340
I know her.

149
00:10:13,780 --> 00:10:15,640
Ah, you guys again?

150
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,700
This guy.

151
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:27,520
It's the samurai Mifune.

152
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,580
Why are you in this place?

153
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:32,260
Why?

154
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:34,700
I'm here doing my duty.

155
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:38,560
My sword is sworn to protect little children like the witch Angela.

156
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,740
But you are also a young child.

157
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:41,800
Why have you come here?

158
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:43,860
What are you doing standing against me again?

159
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,420
Is there a problem?

160
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:48,220
You come with me, Miss Angela.

161
00:10:48,220 --> 00:11:00,420
That's interesting.

162
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:07,060
Get ready.

163
00:11:13,060 --> 00:11:13,880
Let's go.

164
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,120
Infinite sword attack.

165
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:30,020
The swords may only be stuck into the ground, but they all radiate danger.

166
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,040
Oh?

167
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:37,860
A child can withstand Mifune's attack.

168
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:44,460
Blocking my sword and immediately counter-attacking.

169
00:11:44,460 --> 00:11:46,240
I can tell you've improved.

170
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:48,800
Maybe I was wrong.

171
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,840
Perhaps you're not a child anymore.

172
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,020
Don't mess with me!

173
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:58,540
You may know how to talk a big game, but I've beaten you once before and I can do it again.

174
00:11:58,580 --> 00:11:59,740
You didn't beat him, stupid.

175
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,740
Mifune's always nice to kids, no matter what.

176
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:05,920
He never fights seriously against a dumb little boy like you.

177
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,140
What kind of man is he?

178
00:12:08,700 --> 00:12:10,680
You are not to show any mercy.

179
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:11,960
Is that understood?

180
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:18,280
You may be a child, but I won't let myself give in to the same opponent twice.

181
00:12:19,940 --> 00:12:22,240
This is the tour we've heard so much about.

182
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:25,980
If I had to guess, I'd say it's used to alter human morality.

183
00:12:25,980 --> 00:12:32,660
What's this?

184
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:36,380
I'll bring it back.

185
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:40,800
Azusa, what's the situation at the entrance?

186
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:44,780
The academy student is fighting the strong soul from earlier.

187
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:49,380
However, the difference in their relative strengths is overwhelming.

188
00:12:49,380 --> 00:12:59,220
This tool needs to be destroyed immediately.

189
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:05,780
It wasn't part of the plan, but I should be able to take care of this with that student keeping them distracted.

190
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:10,460
Whoever that is out there will need to take him with us.

191
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:14,480
I'll just use your own sword against you.

192
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:23,740
You're still mine!

193
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,540
Three-path shot.

194
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,440
Blackstar!

195
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:39,380
Go, smoke bomb mode!

196
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:41,360
Hmm.

197
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,520
A ninja sword.

198
00:13:43,780 --> 00:13:44,700
A kusarigama.

199
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:45,980
And smoke bomb.

200
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:47,480
That magic weapon.

201
00:13:47,700 --> 00:13:48,620
Is she...?

202
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:49,860
Thanks for that, Hibaki.

203
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:52,080
Now, enchanted sword mode!

204
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:57,140
Indeed, there's no doubt.

205
00:13:57,800 --> 00:14:01,000
It was Lady Arachne's sister who made that kind of magic weapon.

206
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:04,560
Rumor has it that one of those weapons joined the DWMA.

207
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:05,980
It must be her.

208
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:07,080
Oh.

209
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,680
Let's go!

210
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:12,860
There's dark energy coming from this sword.

211
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:14,140
Sabaki!

212
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:14,720
Yes!

213
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,720
Yes!

214
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,360
Yes!

215
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:18,640
Yes!

216
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:18,920
Yes!

217
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:19,200
Yes!

218
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:19,260
Yes!

219
00:14:19,260 --> 00:14:19,320
Yes!

220
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:19,760
Yes!

221
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:19,820
Yes!

222
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:20,320
Yes!

223
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:20,820
Yes!

224
00:14:20,820 --> 00:14:21,320
Yes!

225
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:21,820
Yes!

226
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:22,060
Yes!

227
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:29,760
Is that all you can do, enchanted sword?

228
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,080
Please, please!

229
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,780
Infinite sword attack.

230
00:14:35,580 --> 00:14:36,720
One sword.

231
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:39,760
Two.

232
00:14:40,700 --> 00:14:41,420
Three.

233
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:43,280
Four swords.

234
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:44,300
Five.

235
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:45,100
Six.

236
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:46,780
Seven swords.

237
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:47,780
Eight.

238
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:48,420
Nine.

239
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:49,280
Ten.

240
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:49,900
Eleven.

241
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,800
Twelve swords.

242
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:52,300
Punishment.

243
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:54,360
Punishment.

244
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:59,660
He's striking all of the surrounding swords.

245
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:01,900
Twenty-four blows total.

246
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:06,780
Rather effective to use twelve blades against an enemy.

247
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,280
Black Star!

248
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:16,200
The wounds aren't too deep, but surely you've had enough.

249
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:17,260
Weapon.

250
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:19,100
Your name is Tsubaki, right?

251
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:21,140
Take this child and go.

252
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:24,160
Why would you waste the skills you have to help a witch?

253
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:25,660
Damn it!

254
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,920
She calls that not fighting seriously?

255
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:28,100
Seriously?

256
00:15:28,980 --> 00:15:30,580
Why did you two come here?

257
00:15:30,940 --> 00:15:32,860
Because this lab is run by a witch?

258
00:15:33,560 --> 00:15:36,160
That witch is responsible for hurting our friend.

259
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,980
We came to get revenge.

260
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,320
I'm gonna punish her for what she did to Maka.

261
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:43,640
No one hurts my friend and gets away with it.

262
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:44,600
No one.

263
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:45,740
Do you understand me?

264
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:50,380
I see.

